  "description": "JUST BROWSING? CHECK OUT MY ENTIRE SHOP – CREATIVE WOLF DESIGN\nSet of 12 Red Christmas Digital Paper patterns with glitter effect, perfect for the holiday season.\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality.\nThis set includes minimalist patterns with trees, dots, snowflakes, stars and branches, as well as stripes and “Happy Holidays” lettering in red and white, with some elements with red and silver glitter effect.\nYou also get a FREE set of 16 digital washi tapes.\nThe classic red colour palette with the glitter effect is magical, sparkly and perfect for the Holiday season and allows you to easily mix and match the patterns for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, christmas home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and more.\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (52 MB) and includes:\n• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels\n* 12 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n* 12 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing\n* BONUS 16 washi tapes in PNG and TIFF (both transparent background)\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For better results, use the JPEG or TIFF files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings\nThank you for stopping by!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>JUST BROWSING? CHECK OUT MY ENTIRE SHOP – CREATIVE WOLF DESIGN</p>\n<p>Set of 12 Red Christmas Digital Paper patterns with glitter effect, perfect for the holiday season.<br>\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality.</p>\n<p>This set includes minimalist patterns with trees, dots, snowflakes, stars and branches, as well as stripes and “Happy Holidays” lettering in red and white, with some elements with red and silver glitter effect.<br>\nYou also get a FREE set of 16 digital washi tapes.</p>\n<p>The classic red colour palette with the glitter effect is magical, sparkly and perfect for the Holiday season and allows you to easily mix and match the patterns for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, christmas home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and more.</p>\n<p>This product comes in 1 Zipped folder (52 MB) and includes:</p>\n<p>• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns<br>\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi<br>\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels</p>\n<p>* 12 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use<br>\n* 12 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing</p>\n<p>* BONUS 16 washi tapes in PNG and TIFF (both transparent background)</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:<br>\n• For better results, use the JPEG or TIFF files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use<br>\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings</p>\n<p>Thank you for stopping by!</p>",
